+The manifest is integration input, never collision truth. Old maps come from the
+fixed v10 native commit; current source attributes, connections and authored
+events produce independent walking reachability and the exact repair origin set.
+Historical v10 tables are never regenerated by this script.
+"""
+from __future__ import annotations
