+# Landmark object collision
+
+Collision-only fix against released native `6366b9e5c037647ce4d2a007efa3d3dfbedcdb48`.
+All 10 gym exteriors, the Fine Arts sculpture and the two visit-temple facades
+are checked. Source-art alpha defines occupied native 16×16 cells; transparent
+corners and courtyard gaps stay ordinary city space. The procedural temples
+use their registered facade reserves. Older contract rectangles describe some
+retired facades and are not substituted for the installed artwork masks.
+
+Only 44 Maple Garden words in `data/layouts/TaichungXitun/map.bin` change.
+Each change adds collision bit `0x0400`, retaining the exact metatile ID,
+elevation, art, attributes and rendering layer. Painted paths, decking and grass
+belong to the landmark illustration and are now solid. All other audited
+landmark objects were already solid. No ordinary prop, street, event, warp,
+map size, encounter or cycling eligibility changes.
+
+Maple's native door `(12,32)`, approach `(12,33)` and arrival `(12,35)` remain
+exact. The approach deliberately replaces one raster cell and must stay open.
+Walking and bike both call `CheckForObjectEventCollision`, which calls
+`GetCollisionAtCoords`; its collision-bit rejection happens before elevation
+matching. The changed cells retain normal behavior 0, so ledge/bridge/forced
+movement exceptions do not turn them into traversable terrain.
+
+Later registered increments are checked underneath. The city kit adds pieces to
+the private primaries, and the Xitun rework grows Xitun to 45×69 with this
+layer's 44 cells moved by (+5,+5). Each has its own guard, and this guard reads
+the tree with them removed. `underneath()` gives the release maps underneath
+this layer to guards frozen at the release, such as `check_city_kit`.
+
+Run from the native source checkout:
+
+```sh
+python3 -B tools/taichung/check_landmark_collision.py --self-test
+```
+
+The guard reconstructs the delta independently from pinned artwork alpha and
+the release map, checks unchanged graphics/attributes/layers, all 12 paired
+landmark rooms and all directed district crossings, and rejects reopened art,
+blocked approaches, removed doors and edits to public streets. It also checks
+that no previously reachable non-object cell becomes stranded. JASC palettes
+are compared as complete text lines because Git normalizes their CRLF endings.
+
+`delta.json` records all old/new words and actual saved coordinates. Only native
+map `(43,2)` needs position repair: its 44 listed cells were reachable in the
+released game. Nantun has no newly solid cells. A genuine released-v8 test save
+can be made on `(11,33)`, reached normally from `(11,34)`; the fixed map must
+relocate that saved position to valid exterior ground. `(12,35)` remains a safe
+Maple arrival. Main owns the versioned save/cache migration, derived source
+pins, integrated build and publication. This collision commit does not change
+save code and must not be released without that migration and runtime checks.
