@@ -0,0 +1,80 @@
+# Fengjia: one market-entry proposal
+
+The proposal uses the **actual wavy rainbow street-entry sign**, with four yellow
+stars and two white circular end panels, above compact modern shopfronts and
+practical awnings. This is visible in photograph `1X3A9879` from the
+[official municipal film location gallery](https://filmtaichung.org.tw/scenesContent/113).
+The gallery's other street views establish close-set counters, projecting sign
+boxes and repeated fabric/metal canopies. Its separate Fun Star commercial gate
+is not the model for this asset.
+
+Fengjia is a shopping-and-food street district around Wenhua Road, rather than
+one monumental building. The
+[official Taichung Tourism page](https://travel.taichung.gov.tw/zh-tw/attractions/intro/39)
+places it by the university and extending toward Fuxing Road. The game proposal
+compresses that district into a short entry scene. Its central dark market-lane
+mouth is a **game adaptation for a future gym entrance**, not a surveyed building
+door. Adjacent frontage proportions are representative, not a parcel-by-parcel
+reconstruction. The reference photographs have no supplied capture dates.
+
+Preserve the rainbow banner's shallow curve, four-star rhythm, round end panels,
+awning profiles and narrow storefront rhythm when reducing to native size.
+Simplify window grids, merchandise and metal supports. Keep commercial lettering
+and logos absent; the study leaves blank sign bands for later hand-authored
+localization. Bright sign faces do not imply a citywide nighttime lighting mode.
+
+The single built-in imagegen result is saved unchanged at
+`artifacts/worktrees/c291d4842985/landmark-art/fengjia-study-v1.png` relative to
+the project root. Two official photographs guided the architecture/materials;
+the approved native Station sprite guided pixel treatment only. Exact prompt,
+photo URLs, source hashes, input roles and tool mode are recorded beside this
+brief. No correction generation was needed for the first architecture review.
+
+The image is1536×1024, the requested nominal192×128 at8×, but is a **study**:
+its76,104 visible RGB colors, soft alpha/glow and nonuniform8×8 blocks do not meet
+native format constraints. Alpha ranges0..254, with721,070 partially transparent
+pixels. The useful alpha224 silhouette bounds are(74,283)..(1455,883), exclusive.
+The built-in preview shows the complete asset; local `view_image` renders the
