+Root's integration review:160×96, hard alpha224, coherent2-pixel clusters,
+15 opaque GBA colors,134 unmerged graphics (144 padded). The palette preserves
+the blue/cyan/green/yellow banner, red awnings, both white end panels and four
+separate yellow star components. The tiny stars are4–6 pixels wide and4 pixels
+high; exact points are simplified. `candidate-192/` provides the requested
+unregistered192×128 alternative with larger4–6-pixel-high yellow components,
+at186 graphics (192 padded). The first median-palette160×96 conversion remains
+in `candidate/`; it muted the blue/cyan and is not the recommended input.
