+BULBASAUR	RAZOR_LEAF LEECH_SEED SLEEP_POWDER SYNTHESIS	Seedling sustain: dependable leaves, sleep and seed recovery without weather setup.
+IVYSAUR	RAZOR_LEAF SLUDGE_BOMB SLEEP_POWDER GROWTH	Developing mixed attacker: gains Poison coverage and a Special Attack setup option.
+VENUSAUR	SOLAR_BEAM SUNNY_DAY SLUDGE_BOMB SLEEP_POWDER	Solar finisher: sleep creates an opening for sun and one-turn Solar Beam.
+CHARMANDER	FLAMETHROWER METAL_CLAW DRAGON_RAGE SMOKESCREEN	Young fire dragon: reliable fire, fixed-damage breath and defensive smoke.
+CHARMELEON	FLAMETHROWER SLASH DRAGON_CLAW SCARY_FACE	Claw fighter: sharper attacks and speed control distinguish the middle stage.
+CHARIZARD	FLAMETHROWER FLY DRAGON_CLAW EARTHQUAKE	Winged mixed attacker: iconic flight and fire with Ground coverage against Rock and Electric.
+SQUIRTLE	WATER_PULSE BITE RAPID_SPIN WITHDRAW	Small shell defender: confusion, hazard removal and shell protection support its water attack.
+WARTORTLE	SURF ICE_BEAM BITE PROTECT	Balanced shell scout: dependable water, anti-Grass Ice coverage and scouting protection.
+BLASTOISE	HYDRO_PUMP SURF ICE_BEAM EARTHQUAKE	Cannon specialist: Hydro Pump is the burst option; Surf remains the reliable attack.
+CATERPIE	TACKLE STRING_SHOT NONE NONE	Honest limited larva: its actual two moves provide damage and speed control.
+METAPOD	TACKLE STRING_SHOT HARDEN NONE	Defensive cocoon: retains Caterpie attacks and adds its defining hard shell.
+BUTTERFREE	PSYCHIC GIGA_DRAIN SLEEP_POWDER GUST	Sleep-support butterfly: sleep opens opportunities for special attacks and draining recovery.
+WEEDLE	POISON_STING STRING_SHOT NONE NONE	Honest limited larva: poison and speed control without invented attacks.
+KAKUNA	POISON_STING STRING_SHOT HARDEN NONE	Poison cocoon: retains Weedle attacks and adds defensive hardening.
+BEEDRILL	TWINEEDLE SLUDGE_BOMB BRICK_BREAK SWORDS_DANCE	Physical stinger: Swords Dance supports both STAB attacks and anti-Steel coverage.
+PIDGEY	WING_ATTACK QUICK_ATTACK SAND_ATTACK AGILITY	Nimble fledgling: priority and speed let the small bird act before stronger foes.
+PIDGEOTTO	WING_ATTACK STEEL_WING FEATHER_DANCE QUICK_ATTACK	Disruptive bird: Feather Dance weakens physical opponents while Steel Wing covers Rock and Ice.
+PIDGEOT	FLY DOUBLE_EDGE STEEL_WING FEATHER_DANCE	Powerful adult bird: stronger dual-STAB options, retained attack suppression and useful coverage.
+RATTATA	HYPER_FANG QUICK_ATTACK SHADOW_BALL FOCUS_ENERGY	Scrappy rat: fangs, priority and physical Ghost coverage support a critical-hit identity.
+RATICATE	SUPER_FANG HYPER_FANG SHADOW_BALL SCARY_FACE	Fang specialist: Super Fang halves bulky targets before Hyper Fang finishes them.
+SPEAROW	AERIAL_ACE STEEL_WING LEER AGILITY	Quick spear bird: accurate flight and defense pressure prepare the finishing strike.
+FEAROW	DRILL_PECK DOUBLE_EDGE STEEL_WING AGILITY	Drill bird: stronger physical Flying and Normal STAB reward the evolved form.
+EKANS	ACID BITE GLARE SCREECH	Disruptive snake: Glare and Screech create openings for the rest of the team.
+ARBOK	SLUDGE_BOMB EARTHQUAKE ROCK_SLIDE GLARE	Ambush cobra: strong physical poison and Ground/Rock coverage exploit Glare openings.
+PIKACHU	THUNDERBOLT IRON_TAIL QUICK_ATTACK THUNDER_WAVE	Iconic electric mascot: electric attacks, Iron Tail and priority with useful paralysis.
+RAICHU	THUNDERBOLT BRICK_BREAK THUNDER_WAVE LIGHT_SCREEN	Fast team supporter: stronger Fighting coverage and a special-defense screen.
+SANDSHREW	DIG ROCK_TOMB SLASH DEFENSE_CURL	Burrowing youngster: Dig and defensive curling fit its identity, with Rock Tomb slowing foes.
+SANDSLASH	EARTHQUAKE ROCK_SLIDE SLASH SWORDS_DANCE	Physical sweeper: upgraded Ground and Rock attacks benefit from Swords Dance.
+NIDORAN_F	SLUDGE_BOMB BITE DOUBLE_KICK GROWL	Poison youngster: mixed bites and kicks with a simple defensive debuff.
+NIDORINA	SLUDGE_BOMB BITE BODY_SLAM FLATTER	Disruptive middle stage: Body Slam and Flatter provide distinct status pressure.
+NIDOQUEEN	EARTHQUAKE SLUDGE_BOMB ICE_BEAM SUPERPOWER	Bulky mixed bruiser: dual STAB, Ice coverage and an evolved-form power strike.
+NIDORAN_M	POISON_STING DOUBLE_KICK HORN_ATTACK FOCUS_ENERGY	Young horn attacker: kicks and horn strikes support a critical-hit identity.
+NIDORINO	SLUDGE_BOMB DOUBLE_KICK HORN_ATTACK FOCUS_ENERGY	Growing horn attacker: stronger Poison STAB retains its physical fighting style.
+NIDOKING	EARTHQUAKE SLUDGE_BOMB MEGAHORN THUNDERBOLT	Aggressive mixed king: Megahorn pressures Psychic foes while Thunderbolt covers Water.
+CLEFAIRY	BODY_SLAM PSYCHIC SING MOONLIGHT	Moonlit supporter: sleep and lunar recovery complement practical attacks.
+CLEFABLE	ICE_BEAM THUNDERBOLT CALM_MIND SOFT_BOILED	Durable special attacker: setup and dependable recovery support two coverage beams.
+VULPIX	FLAMETHROWER WILL_O_WISP CONFUSE_RAY QUICK_ATTACK	Tricky fox: burns, confusion and priority help a fragile fire partner contribute.
+NINETALES	FIRE_BLAST FLAMETHROWER CONFUSE_RAY WILL_O_WISP	Tricky evolved fox: Fire Blast supplies burst damage while burns and confusion create openings.
+JIGGLYPUFF	BODY_SLAM SING DEFENSE_CURL ROLLOUT	Balloon performer: sleep buys time for a curling-and-Rollout sequence.
+WIGGLYTUFF	HYPER_VOICE ICE_BEAM THUNDERBOLT SING	Loud mixed performer: iconic Hyper Voice joins broad coverage and sleep support.
+ZUBAT	WING_ATTACK BITE CONFUSE_RAY HAZE	Disruptive cave bat: confusion and Haze support its basic dual attacking options.
+GOLBAT	AERIAL_ACE SLUDGE_BOMB CONFUSE_RAY SCREECH	Physical poison bat: stronger physical STAB benefits from Screech pressure.
+ODDISH	GIGA_DRAIN ACID SLEEP_POWDER MOONLIGHT	Small night plant: draining, sleep and moonlight form a self-sufficient support set.
+GLOOM	GIGA_DRAIN SLUDGE_BOMB STUN_SPORE MOONLIGHT	Status middle stage: paralysis and improved attacks distinguish it from the seedling.
+VILEPLUME	PETAL_DANCE SLUDGE_BOMB SLEEP_POWDER AROMATHERAPY	Blooming flower: signature Petal Dance and team-wide status relief reward evolution.
+PARAS	GIGA_DRAIN SLASH STUN_SPORE LEECH_LIFE	Forest forager: cutting attacks and draining moves support paralysis utility.
+PARASECT	SPORE SLASH GIGA_DRAIN SWORDS_DANCE	Mushroom ambusher: accurate Spore creates an opening for boosted physical cuts.
+VENONAT	PSYBEAM GIGA_DRAIN POISON_POWDER STUN_SPORE	Powder scout: two distinct status choices support psychic damage and draining recovery.
+VENOMOTH	PSYCHIC SILVER_WIND SLEEP_POWDER GIGA_DRAIN	Special moth: sleep supports stronger special attacks; Silver Wind supplies Bug identity.
+DIGLETT	DIG ROCK_TOMB SLASH SAND_ATTACK	Small burrower: lower-commitment Ground identity and speed or accuracy disruption.
+DUGTRIO	EARTHQUAKE ROCK_SLIDE SLASH AERIAL_ACE	Fast physical finisher: upgraded Ground pressure and practical coverage without setup turns.
+MEOWTH	PAY_DAY BITE FAKE_OUT SCREECH	Street trickster: iconic Pay Day and Fake Out with defense pressure.
+PERSIAN	SLASH SHADOW_BALL FAKE_OUT SCREECH	Swift physical cat: critical cuts and physical Ghost coverage exploit its better attack.
+PSYDUCK	WATER_PULSE CONFUSION DISABLE SCREECH	Confused duck: thematic psychic tricks and disruption accompany its water move.
+GOLDUCK	SURF ICE_BEAM HYDRO_PUMP CALM_MIND	Focused special swimmer: Calm Mind boosts its reliable and burst Water options plus Ice coverage.
+MANKEY	KARATE_CHOP LOW_KICK FOCUS_ENERGY LEER	Scrappy martial learner: critical chops, weight-based kicks and defense pressure.
+PRIMEAPE	CROSS_CHOP ROCK_SLIDE EARTHQUAKE BULK_UP	Aggressive physical fighter: powerful crit-oriented Fighting STAB and setup-supported coverage.
+GROWLITHE	FLAMETHROWER BITE TAKE_DOWN ROAR	Young guard dog: fire and physical tackles with an intimidation-themed phazing option.
+ARCANINE	FLAMETHROWER EXTREME_SPEED BITE IRON_TAIL	Fast guardian: evolved Extreme Speed is the signature finisher, with useful mixed coverage.
+POLIWAG	WATER_PULSE BODY_SLAM HYPNOSIS BELLY_DRUM	Sleepy tadpole: hypnosis can create a risky opening for a physical Body Slam sweep.
+POLIWHIRL	SURF ICE_BEAM BODY_SLAM HYPNOSIS	Balanced middle stage: safe water and Ice attacks retain the family's sleep identity.
+POLIWRATH	SURF BRICK_BREAK EARTHQUAKE BELLY_DRUM	Physical fighting swimmer: Belly Drum is the high-risk boost for its physical coverage.
+ABRA	PSYCHIC SHOCK_WAVE REFLECT LIGHT_SCREEN	Frail screen setter: contributes reliable special attacks and protects the rest of the team.
+KADABRA	PSYCHIC SHOCK_WAVE RECOVER REFLECT	Developing psychic: recovery and physical protection support its growing special offense.
+ALAKAZAM	PSYCHIC SHOCK_WAVE CALM_MIND RECOVER	Focused special sweeper: Calm Mind, Psychic and recovery form a coherent plan.
+MACHOP	KARATE_CHOP LOW_KICK FOCUS_ENERGY FORESIGHT	Martial learner: Foresight lets its Fighting attacks threaten normally immune Ghosts.
+MACHOKE	REVENGE VITAL_THROW ROCK_SLIDE BULK_UP	Patient counterfighter: absorbs a hit and retaliates, with Bulk Up supporting that role.
+MACHAMP	CROSS_CHOP ROCK_SLIDE EARTHQUAKE BULK_UP	Four-armed bruiser: strong physical attacks and setup without relying on later-generation abilities.
+BELLSPROUT	RAZOR_LEAF ACID SLEEP_POWDER GROWTH	Young pitcher plant: special leaf attacks, sleep and Growth establish its basic plan.
+WEEPINBELL	GIGA_DRAIN SLUDGE_BOMB STUN_SPORE GROWTH	Draining middle stage: paralysis and healing damage differentiate its support role.
+VICTREEBEL	RAZOR_LEAF SLUDGE_BOMB SLEEP_POWDER SWORDS_DANCE	Carnivorous mixed attacker: sleep enables Swords Dance for physical Sludge Bomb; leaves provide unboosted Grass damage.
+TENTACOOL	BUBBLE_BEAM ACID BARRIER SUPERSONIC	Defensive jelly: barrier and confusion support its developing special offense.
+TENTACRUEL	SURF ICE_BEAM SLUDGE_BOMB BARRIER	Armored special swimmer: Barrier covers physical vulnerability while Surf and Ice use its special stats.
