+## Placement and collision work
+
+Fengjia's rainbow sign, four yellow stars and round end panels survive conversion. The central dark lane has opaque pixels rather than a transparent walkable corridor or painted door. Keep door24,12, approach24,13 and arrival24,15; explicitly adapt the one native portal cell and review the entry animation. Do not claim the entire sign's lane is passable from alpha occupancy.
