+
+CMP keeps its planted white/bronze facade and existing native park space in front. A measured hypothetical origin18,27 aligns local portal4,9 with door22,36; approach22,37 and arrival22,39 stay outside its envelope. The broad painted entrance spans cells, so the one-cell General door replacement still needs visual/animation acceptance. Its palette8 proposal preserves indices0–7 and13 exactly, changing only the seven independently proven unused indices8,9,10,11,12,14,15. Candidate conversion preserves loaded palette index0 as well as PNG transparency. None of these changes is applied to the current bank.
+
+## Bank capacity and engine gate
+
+Read-only frozen-e9 analyses are reproducible with `tools/taichung/landmarks/analyze_xitun_primary.py` and `analyze_greenway_primary.py`. Their reports are under the matching `xitun-primary-plan/` and `greenway-primary-plan/` artifact directories.
