+- [Taichung Tourism: Yizhong Shopping District (en)](https://travel.taichung.gov.tw/en/attractions/intro/1551) and [一中商圈 (zh)](https://taichung.travel/zh-tw/attractions/intro/400): the district sits near Chung Yo Department Store and runs into the Sanmin shopping area. It is near Taichung First Senior High School, the National Taichung University of Science and Technology and the National Taiwan University of Sport. It is crowded with students, with snack stalls and eateries everywhere. Street food is on Yucai Street and most clothing shops are in the small lanes.
