+# Old City and Greenway rework: draft (phase 2a)
+
+Draft v5, 8 November 2026: v4 plus the approved Old City North split, and tile-efficient redraws of landmarks 14, 15 and 17 in Old City North's new secondary. Docs and blockouts only: no map.bin, border, tileset, event or save change.
+
+The draft follows the cell-exact master plan (`artifacts/city-rework/masterplan.json` sha `324030a5` and `plan.png` at the repo root). All coordinates are today's world tiles unless marked *local*, and rect ends are exclusive. It replaces draft v1, which followed the first brief: 40-wide Old City, a river along Greenway's south edge and the Liuchuan canal on the seam.
+
+The blockouts use 16 px per tile in map-local coordinates, so they lay straight onto `plan.png`:
+
+- `artifacts/city-rework/drafts/greenway.png` and `oldcity.png` (repo root). `oldcity.png` holds both Old City North and Old City, one above the other, with the row-48 seam dashed in pink. These are the clean versions for the board, in its legend colours:
+  - asphalt `#4b505c`, sidewalks `#d6d0c2`;
+  - water `#3f86d4`, banks `#c9c1a8`;
+  - park `#86bd6c`, plaza `#eadfc4`;
+  - real live tiles wherever today's content is kept;
+  - new land hatched white, and tall-grass patches outlined in yellow.
+- `artifacts/city-rework/drafts/oldcity-miyahara.png` is the Miyahara close-up.
+- `artifacts/city-rework/drafts/oldcity-landmark-redraws.png` and `oldcity-landmarks.png` set the landmarks' plan art beside the redraws and the fitted art.
+- Framed versions with world and local rulers, legend and connection-strip hatching, plus the world overlay and `draft.json`, are under `artifacts/city-rework/oldcity/v2/` in the Old City session's worktree.
