+# Park gym slice
+
+This isolated slice starts from released native `d7053fd`. Only the existing
+Park host becomes a voluntary challenge; map geometry, Jun, the presenter
+save, bike speed and the other eight inactive halls are not changed. Park is
+trainer 744 and permanent completion bit 1. Jun remains trainer 743/bit 0.
