+team come from Story's authored proposals. Exact roster, three-member size,
+balance and dialogue remain revisable defaults. The proposed Pavilion Badge /
+湖亭徽章 title is not used in this slice; earned feedback names the Park badge.
+The first move sets match the common level-50 curated presets. Trainer custom
+move flags must preserve those authored moves during common-level preparation;
+default-set trainers, including Jun, retain their existing curated behavior.
