+Imported unchanged from Interface review-v3 artwork commit `02a8a39`; user approval recorded in `c8e91e7` on 2026-11-09. All ten icons are approved, including the theater curtain/stage revision. Source PNGs retain the exact common palette and index0 transparency. `assets.json` pins stable gym bits0–9, display numbers1–10, bilingual names and payload hashes.
+
+`collection.4bpp.bin` is 10 consecutive16×16 images,128 bytes each. `award.4bpp.bin` is 10 consecutive32×32 images,512 bytes each. Both use native1D OBJ tile order: icon,8×8 tile rows, tile columns, rows, packed pixel pairs with left pixel in low nibble. These tracked binary inputs are exact Interface payloads, not generated horizontal-sheet conversions. `earned.gbapal.bin` contains16 little-endian RGB555 colors. Native code supplies a neutral silhouette palette for unearned badges.
+
+Collection and award presentation read existing gym progress. These assets do not grant badges or write saves. Main owns final glyph union, build and UI verification.
