+        require('gSaveBlock1Ptr == NULL || UseContinueGameWarp()' in wrapper and 'warp->warpId != -1' in wrapper and 'warp->mapGroup != gSaveBlock1Ptr->location.mapGroup' in wrapper and 'warp->mapNum != gSaveBlock1Ptr->location.mapNum' in wrapper, 'Facing API priority/identity guard differs')
+        require(wrapper.count('RememberCacheRefreshFacing(') == 1 and wrapper.count(delegate) == 1, 'Facing wrapper must delegate once')
