+#!/usr/bin/env python3
+"""Guest house opening and no waterway signs, as one exact layer over BASE.
+
+The user asked (2026-11-10) for two outdoor changes:
+
+- The game no longer opens inside an Old Station welcome hall that is not the
+  Old Station gym. A new game wakes in a FireRed player's-house bedroom (the
+  original PALLET_TOWN_PLAYERS_HOUSE layouts, as new Taichung maps), and the
+  player walks out of the small red-roofed house just west of the station
+  canal. Its painted door, Old City (20,67), becomes a working door: a copy of
+  the door metatile 0x3DB in the blank private-bank slot 0x3FE with the
+  MB_WARP_DOOR behaviour, plus warp 3 to the guest house. Only that one cell
+  changes metatile; its collision stays solid (FireRed enters a door by
+  pressing toward it). Xiaoyu, the city guide, now waits beside that door at
+  (21,68) instead of the plaza at (28,66), so the outdoor tips start next to her
+  (she faces west, the player east). (19,68) and (20,68) are save-repair targets
+  for older saves, so she stands on a square no repair can send a player to.
+- Waterway signs go: GREEN RIVER and HAN CREEK (Old City) and FAZI RIVER
+  (Wanhe). Han Creek's and Fazi River's signposts become the ground beside
+  them; Green River's sign had no post (the approved Prefectural Hall art
+  covers that spot), so only its event goes.
+
+Every changed cell opens or keeps ground: no cell becomes newly blocked, so no
+saved position needs repair.
+
+The opening's scripts, text and the two new maps are pinned by hash, and the
+BASE copy of every edited file ships in data/taichung/home-start/baseline, so
+this check is portable (no native git history). Older registered guards read
