+    # live Xitun, which carries the registered collision layer. Overrides
+    # (probes) describe that state. The registered Nantun rework (check_nantun)
+    # likewise leaves the release North and Wanhe underneath it.
+    oldcity = support.oldcity_rework_underneath(actual)
